            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Christmas is coming, Santa is on his way. However, not everyone likes his visiting,  play this game to find out why.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's snowball fighting in VR! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove your head to dodge incoming attacks, and counter their snowballs with yours to show them your excellent snowball fighting skills. <br />\r\nCompete your high score with other players and rank yourself as high as possible on the leader board!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game designed for VR from the ground up, No keyboard or controllers are required, very easy to pick up.<br />\r\nA fun and entertaining game for you and your family!",
            "about_the_game": "Christmas is coming, Santa is on his way. However, not everyone likes his visiting,  play this game to find out why.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt's snowball fighting in VR! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nMove your head to dodge incoming attacks, and counter their snowballs with yours to show them your excellent snowball fighting skills. <br />\r\nCompete your high score with other players and rank yourself as high as possible on the leader board!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a game designed for VR from the ground up, No keyboard or controllers are required, very easy to pick up.<br />\r\nA fun and entertaining game for you and your family!",
            "short_description": "It's a snowball fight in VR! Shoot, dodge, and level up to defeat those crazy kids. Even battle fireworks and a monster house! Finish this game you will find out Santa's dark secret. An intense and entertaining journey for you and your family!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
